{"id":"ca39c110894da886","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-proof-complexity.md","title":"Proof Complexity","display":"df-proof-complexity — Proof Complexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-proof-complexity","aliases":["72-df-proof-complexity"],"display":"df-proof-complexity — Proof Complexity","depends_on":["[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]","[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]","[[72-df-first-order-formula]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563; local finite-sequence proof interface reconstructed from the supplied calls","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-proof-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-proof-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-proof-complexity — Proof Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c943d760d42086b\" href=\"?note=2c943d760d42086b\" title=\"72-df-first-order-formula\">72-df-first-order-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, sections 2.2-2.3; printed pp. 550-551; PDF pp. 562-563; local finite-sequence proof interface reconstructed from the supplied calls"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d26f8820bf776b8c\" href=\"?note=d26f8820bf776b8c\" title=\"72-df-syntactic-proof-system\">72-df-syntactic-proof-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；实际证明接口是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)\\)</span>，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" href=\"?note=c42b7f1faaf95a1c\" title=\"72-df-finite-sequence-proof\">72-df-finite-sequence-proof</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 为有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Gamma=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 的有效有限字母表语法及固定的单射、有效的通常有限证明编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\">\\(|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|\\)</span> 为编码位数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 大于每个自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_P(\\tau):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|:\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_P(\\tau):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|:\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)\\},&amp;\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\infty,&amp;\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节点定义有限公式序列证明的最短二进制编码长度，无证明时取附加元素∞；不包含最优证明系统存在性的断言。五参数ProofObject及对应SyntacticProofSystem已在72内部显式重建。编码是Hypothesis中的固定参数，因而最短长度可依编码而变；没有假定所有有效编码之间多项式等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2c943d760d42086b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-syntactic-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"d26f8820bf776b8c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,\\Sigma)$ (see [[72-df-syntactic-proof-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-sequence-proof","status":"resolved","id":"c42b7f1faaf95a1c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$；实际证明接口是 $\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)$，取 [[72-df-finite-sequence-proof]]。$\\pi$ 为有限公式序列，$\\Gamma=\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SyntacticProofSystem}(P,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\Gamma,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}:\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"S_P(\\tau):=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\{|\\operatorname{enc}(\\pi)|:\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma)\\},&\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma),\\\\\n\\infty,&\\neg\\exists\\pi\\;\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,\\varnothing,\\tau,P,\\Sigma).\n\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":2024,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-complexity|df-proof-complexity — Proof Complexity]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-241","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-proof-complexity|df-proof-complexity — Proof Complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["d26f8820bf776b8c","c42b7f1faaf95a1c","2c943d760d42086b"]}